WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:03.767
Welcome, welcome to "The Tonight Show"!

00:00:03.767 --> 00:00:07.234
You're here. You made it. Let's get to some news.

00:00:07.234 --> 00:00:08.968
Well, guys, today President Biden

00:00:08.968 --> 00:00:12.467
traveled to Egypt for the U.N. Climate Change Summit.

00:00:12.467 --> 00:00:14.634
Yeah, I'm worried all the traveling from the midterms

00:00:14.634 --> 00:00:17.100
was taking it out on Biden, because he showed up to Egypt

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:19.234
and asked to meet the leader of Wakanda.

00:00:19.234 --> 00:00:21.033
[ Laughter ]

00:00:25.267 --> 00:00:26.834
But the Climate Summit is important.

00:00:26.834 --> 00:00:28.968
It's where world leaders fly long distances

00:00:28.968 --> 00:00:32.033
in their private jets to discuss how to help the environment.

00:00:32.033 --> 00:00:34.601
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:36.934
[ Applause ]

00:00:36.934 --> 00:00:38.434
You like that?

00:00:38.434 --> 00:00:39.634
-Come on. It was a good one.

00:00:39.634 --> 00:00:41.767
-Meanwhile, the U.N. Secretary General

00:00:41.767 --> 00:00:43.701
was addressing the summit when he realized

00:00:43.701 --> 00:00:45.501
that something wasn't right. Watch this.

00:00:45.501 --> 00:00:47.601
-You have been relentless

00:00:47.601 --> 00:00:50.100
in holding decision makers to account.

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:55.300
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:58.234
I think that I was given the wrong speech.

00:00:58.234 --> 00:01:01.067
Um, I'm going to speak

00:01:01.067 --> 00:01:03.767
to a group of young people afterwards.

00:01:03.767 --> 00:01:05.234
[ Rim shot ]

00:01:05.234 --> 00:01:06.567
[ Applause ]

00:01:06.567 --> 00:01:08.634
-Eventually he got the right speech and was like,

00:01:08.634 --> 00:01:10.868
"Okay, here it is. Uh...

00:01:10.868 --> 00:01:12.734
Wassup, playas?"

00:01:12.734 --> 00:01:13.701
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.701 --> 00:01:17.234
"This is not the right one."

00:01:17.234 --> 00:01:19.300
Then he left the building and got in the wrong motorcade.

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:21.701
It was just -- The whole day was interesting.

00:01:21.701 --> 00:01:23.234
Well, next week, former president Trump

00:01:23.234 --> 00:01:26.234
is expected to announce he is running for president again,

00:01:26.234 --> 00:01:28.334
but that's actually just one of the rumored announcements

00:01:28.334 --> 00:01:30.133
that he plans on making.

00:01:30.133 --> 00:01:32.701
Yeah, for example, he's also announcing that...

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:37.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:37.033 --> 00:01:38.934
It's a rumor.

00:01:38.934 --> 00:01:40.901
He's also telling people...

00:01:43.167 --> 00:01:44.601
I don't know what that means.

00:01:44.601 --> 00:01:46.767
[ Applause ]

00:01:46.767 --> 00:01:48.701
That's not all. Trump says that...

00:01:51.734 --> 00:01:53.000
Oh, that's fun.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:55.033
[ Applause ]

00:01:55.033 --> 00:01:56.901
Then he might announce that...

00:02:00.901 --> 00:02:03.167
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:03.167 --> 00:02:04.801
That's great.

00:02:04.801 --> 00:02:06.434
And finally...

00:02:10.167 --> 00:02:14.200
These are just rumors. Rumors.

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:15.634
Well, some business news.

00:02:15.634 --> 00:02:18.467
The CEO of Delta Airlines said that there is no possibility

00:02:18.467 --> 00:02:20.934
of pilot strikes over the holidays.

00:02:20.934 --> 00:02:22.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:22.434 --> 00:02:24.400
So...

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:26.033
Depending on if you cheered or booed,

00:02:26.033 --> 00:02:28.133
it really says a lot on how you feel about your family.

00:02:28.133 --> 00:02:29.567
It really does.

00:02:29.567 --> 00:02:31.000
This side of the --

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:34.200
This side of the -- Yeah, yeah. You know who you are.

00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:35.601
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.601 --> 00:02:37.767
Switching gears, I saw that bitcoin is crashing,

00:02:37.767 --> 00:02:39.934
and it actually just hit a two-year low.

00:02:39.934 --> 00:02:45.801
Right now bitcoin is worth about as much as a Dr. Oz yard sign.

00:02:45.801 --> 00:02:48.234
-Hey-oh!

00:02:48.234 --> 00:02:49.634
Ohh!

00:02:49.634 --> 00:02:52.167
